<details><summary>Reveal the factorization proof</summary>
If $E=e\circ F$, equal functional images have equal experience. Conversely, if experience is constant on every fibre, assign to each realized profile the experiential value of any representative. Constancy makes this independent of the representative.
</details>

A useful comparison is [sufficient statistics](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sufficient_statistic): a representation is sufficient for a target exactly when the target does not vary inside the representation's fibres.

