## What the model does—and does not—show

Functional organization alone never guarantees a zombie. If $E(x)=1$ for every state, no void state exists under any observation map. The split model therefore offers a conditional representation theorem: once a Boolean experiential splitting is assumed, twins are unique, functionally zero-distance, and classified by behavioral profiles.

